  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to end Gender Based Violence in Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to empower voices and supports to end Gender-Based Violence ensuring that Individual community members have the knowledge, skills, attitudes, and effective collaborative mechanisms to prevent and respond to GBV. The project also aims to systematically support stakeholders to have the capacity and coordination to advocate for, develop and deliver GBV prevention and response services.</narrative>
  </description>
